  "entries": [
    {
      "text": "Thank you for calling VeloFit. Your call may be recorded for quality assurance. Please wait while we connect you to the next available agent.",
      "speakerId": "AUTOMATED_AGENT",
      "role": "AUTOMATED_AGENT",
      "user_id": 0,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1768002807000000
    },
    {
      "text": "Thank you for holding. My name is Diana. How can I help you today?",
      "speakerId": "AGENT",
      "role": "AGENT",
      "user_id": 401,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1768002816600000
    },
    {
      "text": "I need to return something.",
      "speakerId": "CUSTOMER",
      "role": "CUSTOMER",
      "user_id": 22795,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1768002821200000
    },
    {
      "text": "I can certainly look into that for you. Could I have your name and order number, please?",
      "speakerId": "AGENT",
      "role": "AGENT",
      "user_id": 401,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1768002823200000
    },
    {
      "text": "Mark Peterson. Order 778-01B-94C.",
      "speakerId": "CUSTOMER",
      "role": "CUSTOMER",
      "user_id": 22795,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1768002829266666
    },
    {
      "text": "Thank you, Mark. I see your order for the Trail Helmet. To get started, could you tell me a bit more about the issue? Is it a technical fault with the helmet or more of a preference?",
      "speakerId": "AGENT",
      "role": "AGENT",
      "user_id": 401,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1768002831666666
    },
    {
      "text": "The color. It's not what I expected.",
      "speakerId": "CUSTOMER",
      "role": "CUSTOMER",
      "user_id": 22795,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1768002843999999
    },
    {
      "text": "I see. So it's just about the color, then? No issues with the fit or any of the safety features?",
      "speakerId": "AGENT",
      "role": "AGENT",
      "user_id": 401,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1768002846599999
    },
    {
      "text": "No. The box is unopened. I just don't like it.",
      "speakerId": "CUSTOMER",
      "role": "CUSTOMER",
      "user_id": 22795,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1768002853199999
    },
    {
      "text": "Okay, thank you for clarifying. Let me just check the delivery date here... It looks like it was delivered 40 days ago. One moment while I review our policy.",
      "speakerId": "AGENT",
      "role": "AGENT",
      "user_id": 401,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1768002856466665
    },
    {
      "text": "Fine.",
      "speakerId": "CUSTOMER",
      "role": "CUSTOMER",
      "user_id": 22795,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1768002867133331
    },
    {
      "text": "Alright, Mark, I've confirmed it. Your Trail Helmet is a standard item, and it's well within our 90-day return window. I can go ahead and process that return for you right now.",
      "speakerId": "AGENT",
      "role": "AGENT",
      "user_id": 401,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1768002867833331
    },
    {
      "text": "Whatever. Just send the label.",
      "speakerId": "CUSTOMER",
      "role": "CUSTOMER",
      "user_id": 22795,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1768002879766664
    },
    {
      "text": "Of course. We want to ensure you're completely satisfied with your gear, as your safety on the trail is our priority. I've just sent a pre-paid return label to the email on file. Just print it, attach it to the box, and drop it off at any UPS location. You'll receive a full refund once we receive the item.",
      "speakerId": "AGENT",
      "role": "AGENT",
      "user_id": 401,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1768002881966664
    },
    {
      "text": "Yeah, I got it. Is that everything?",
      "speakerId": "CUSTOMER",
      "role": "CUSTOMER",
      "user_id": 22795,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1768002902633330
    },
    {
      "text": "Yes, that's all. Was there anything else I could help you with today?",
